	ommp021OtuLossOfFrameAlarm OBJECT-TYPE
              SYNTAX  DisplayString
              MAX-ACCESS  read-only
              STATUS  current
              DESCRIPTION
			"For port configured with OTU4/OTUC2 traffic, if
			OTU4/OTUC2 frame received are in out-of-frame (OOF)
			state for 3 ms, then OTU-LOF Alarm is generated
